From 588e04f1977e028e776b6072cbd68d4dd1ffb350 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dallas Delaney <dadelan@microsoft.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 17:13:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] erofs: name signed metadata schema semantically

Rename the registry-facing dm-verity referrer, EROFS metadata media type,
and propagated descriptor label without changing tar-index implementation
terminology.

Signed-off-by: Dallas Delaney <dadelan@microsoft.com>
Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
Copilot-Session: 925784b1-44a7-4d56-b04f-e527d2e0879f
---
